---
# Full HTML page with no layout. Front matter is needed so Eleventy renders it as a template.
---
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">

<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
  <title>BioInfoTraining-Community</title>
  <meta name="description"
    content="BioInfoTraining-Community: a community space for bioinformatics training, translations and contributions.">

  <!-- EMBL-EBI Visual Framework 2.5.30 and EBI global header/footer -->
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://assets.emblstatic.net/vf/v2.5.30/css/styles.css">
  <link rel="stylesheet"
    href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@visual-framework/ebi-header-footer@2.1.5/ebi-header-footer.css">
  <style>
    .customBadgeGrey {
      background-color: #f3f3f3 !important;
      border: 0 !important;
      border-radius: 2px !important;
      color: #373a36 !important;
      font-weight: 500 !important;
      font-size: 12px !important;
    }

    .customBadgeBlue {
      background-color: #3b6fb6 !important;
      border: #3b6fb6;
      border-radius: 2px !important;
      color: #fff !important;
      font-weight: 500 !important;
      font-size: 12px !important;
    }
  </style>

</head>

<body>

  <!-- Tell the VF 1.4 not to display a data protection banner. -->
  <!-- You should use the 2.0 data protection banner from the contentHub. -->
  <span data-protection-message-disable="true"></span>
  <!-- embl-ebi global header -->
  <header id="masthead-black-bar" class="clearfix masthead-black-bar | ebi-header-footer vf-content vf-u-fullbleed">
    <div></div>
    <div>
      <nav id="search-bar" class="search-bar global-masthead-interactive-banner">
        <div class="row padding-bottom-medium">
          <div class="columns padding-top-medium">
            <button class="close-button" aria-label="Close alert" type="button">
              <span aria-hidden="true">x</span>
            </button>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="row">
          <form id="global-search" name="global-search" action="/ebisearch/search.ebi" method="GET" class="">
            <div>
              <div class="input-group">
                <label class="vf-form__label vf-u-sr-only" for="global-searchbox">Search all of EMBL-EBI</label>
                <input type="text" name="query" id="global-searchbox" class="input-group-field"
                  placeholder="Search all of EMBL-EBI">
                <div class="input-group-button">
                  <input type="submit" name="submit" value="Search" class="button">
                  <input type="hidden" name="db" value="allebi" checked="checked">
                  <input type="hidden" name="requestFrom" value="masthead-black-bar" checked="checked">
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </form>
        </div>
      </nav>
    </div>
    <div>
      <nav class="row">
        <ul id="global-nav" class="menu global-nav text-right" data-vf-google-analytics-region="Black bar">
          <li class="float-right show-for-medium embl-ebi">
            <a class="float-right" style="color: transparent;" href="https://www.ebi.ac.uk">EMBL-EBI</a>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </nav>
    </div>
  </header>
  <div class="vf-body">
    <main id="top">

      <section class="vf-hero vf-hero--800 vf-u-fullbleed">
        <div class="vf-hero__content vf-box vf-stack vf-stack--400">
          <p class="vf-hero__kicker">Community space</p>
          <h1 class="vf-hero__heading">BioinTraining Community</h1>
          <p class="vf-hero__text">BioinTraining Community brings together training resources, community translations and contributions for the life sciences, developed openly on GitHub.</p>
        </div>
      </section>

      <div class="vf-content">

        <section id="spaces" aria-labelledby="spaces-heading">
          <div class="vf-section-header">
            <h2 class="vf-section-header__heading" id="spaces-heading">Our spaces</h2>
            <p>The Community Space is a collaborative platform where scientific communities can share, translate and
              improve training resources. It supports knowledge exchange, makes learning materials more accessible
              across languages and regions, and creates opportunities for communities to contribute their expertise
              and connect with one another.</p>
            <p class="vf-section-header__subheading">Thematic areas of the community. Each one hosts its own content,
              maintainers and roadmap.</p>
            <div class="vf-u-padding--400"></div>
          </div>
          <div
            class="homepage-summaries vf-u-fullbleed vf-u-background-color-ui--grey--light vf-u-padding__top--500 vf-u-padding__bottom--600">
            <div class="vf-grid vf-grid__col-2">
              <article class="vf-card vf-card--brand vf-card--bordered">
                <div class="vf-card__content vf-stack vf-stack--400">
                  <span class="vf-badge vf-badge--primary vf-u-margin__right--200 customBadgeBlue">Active</span>
                  <h3 class="vf-card__heading"><a class="vf-card__link" href="/spaces/alphafold/">AlphaFold and
                      structural biology <svg aria-hidden="true"
                        class="vf-card__heading__icon | vf-icon vf-icon-arrow--inline-end" width="1em" height="1em"
                        xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
                        <path
                          d="M0 12c0 6.627 5.373 12 12 12s12-5.373 12-12S18.627 0 12 0C5.376.008.008 5.376 0 12zm13.707-5.209l4.5 4.5a1 1 0 010 1.414l-4.5 4.5a1 1 0 01-1.414-1.414l2.366-2.367a.25.25 0 00-.177-.424H6a1 1 0 010-2h8.482a.25.25 0 00.177-.427l-2.366-2.368a1 1 0 011.414-1.414z"
                          fill="currentColor" fill-rule="nonzero"></path>
                      </svg>
                    </a></h3>
                  <p class="vf-card__text">Practical guidance on predicting and interpreting protein structures with
                    AlphaFold, and the foundations of protein structure behind it.</p>
                </div>
              </article>
              <article class="vf-card vf-card--brand vf-card--bordered">
                <div class="vf-card__content vf-stack vf-stack--400">
                  <span class="vf-badge vf-badge--primary vf-u-margin__right--200 customBadgeGrey">Future</span>
                  <h3 class="vf-card__heading">Ensembl </h3>

                  <p class="vf-card__text">Genome annotation and browsing resources, planned as a future space.</p>
                </div>
              </article>
              <article class="vf-card vf-card--brand vf-card--bordered">
                <div class="vf-card__content vf-stack vf-stack--400">
                  <span class="vf-badge vf-badge--primary vf-u-margin__right--200 customBadgeGrey">Future</span>
                  <h3 class="vf-card__heading">Biocuration</h3>
                  <p class="vf-card__text">Curation practice and community-maintained biological data, planned as a
                    future space.</p>
                </div>
              </article>
              <article class="vf-card vf-card--brand vf-card--bordered">
                <div class="vf-card__content vf-stack vf-stack--400">
                  <span class="vf-badge vf-badge--primary vf-u-margin__right--200 customBadgeGrey">Future</span>
                  <h3 class="vf-card__heading">Infrastructure &amp; services</h3>
                  <p class="vf-card__text">Shared tools, computing infrastructure and services for the community,
                    planned as a future space.</p>
                </div>
              </article>
            </div>
          </div>
        </section>

        <div
          class="vf-u-fullbleed vf-u-background-color-ui--off-white | vf-u-padding__top--500 vf-u-padding__bottom--600 explore-container" style="background-image: url(https://acxngcvroo.cloudimg.io/v7/www.embl.org/files/wp-content/uploads/20230522_EMBL-org-explore_s-scaled.jpg); background-color: transparent;">
          <section id="community" aria-labelledby="community-heading">
            <div class="vf-section-header">
              <h2 class="vf-section-header__heading" id="community-heading" style="color: #fff;">Community content</h2>
              <p class="vf-section-header__subheading" style="color: #fff;">Resources that cut across every space: ways to contribute and news.</p>
              <div class="vf-u-padding--400"></div>
            </div>
            <div class="vf-grid vf-grid__col-4">
              <article class="vf-card">
                <div class="vf-card__content vf-stack vf-stack--400">
                  <h3 class="vf-card__heading"><a class="vf-card__link"
                      href="https://github.com/BioInfoCommunity/AlphaFold-A-practical-guide">About</a></h3>
                  <p class="vf-card__text">Training resources, community translations and contributions</p>
                </div>
              </article>
              <article class="vf-card">
                <div class="vf-card__content vf-stack vf-stack--400">
                  <h3 class="vf-card__heading"><a class="vf-card__link"
                      href="https://github.com/BioInfoCommunity/AlphaFold-A-practical-guide">Github</a></h3>
                  <p class="vf-card__text">Access the Github repositories for contributors</p>
                </div>
              </article>
              <article class="vf-card">
                <div class="vf-card__content vf-stack vf-stack--400">
                  <h3 class="vf-card__heading"><a class="vf-card__link"
                      href="https://github.com/BioInfoCommunity/AlphaFold-A-practical-guide">Get involved</a></h3>
                  <p class="vf-card__text">Get in touch to participate as a contributor or moderator</p>
                </div>
              </article>
              <article class="vf-card">
                <div class="vf-card__content vf-stack vf-stack--400">
                  <h3 class="vf-card__heading"><a class="vf-card__link"
                      href="https://github.com/BioInfoCommunity">Feedback</a></h3>
                  <p class="vf-card__text">Help us improve by letting us know your feedback</p>
                </div>
              </article>
            </div>
          </section>


        </div>

        <div class="vf-content vf-box">
          <section id="news" aria-labelledby="news-heading">
            <div class="vf-section-header">
              <h2 class="vf-section-header__heading" id="news-heading">News</h2>
              <p class="vf-section-header__subheading">Updates, new translations, activities and opportunities to contribute.</p>
              <div class="vf-u-padding--400"></div>
            </div>
            {% if news.home.length %}
            <div class="vf-grid vf-grid__col-3">
              {% for item in news.home %}
              <article class="vf-card">
                <div class="vf-card__content vf-stack vf-stack--400">
                  <p class="vf-card__subheading">{{ item.displayDate }}</p>
                  <h3 class="vf-card__heading">{% if item.url %}<a class="vf-card__link" href="{{ item.url }}">{{ item.title }}</a>{% else %}{{ item.title }}{% endif %}</h3>
                  <p class="vf-card__text">{{ item.description }}</p>
                </div>
              </article>
              {% endfor %}
            </div>
            {% else %}
            <p>No news yet.</p>
            {% endif %}
          </section>
        </div>

      </div>
      <div class="vf-u-padding--400"></div>
    </main>
  </div>

  <!-- embl-ebi global footer -->
  <footer class="vf-footer" data-vf-google-analytics-region="ebi-footer">
    <div class="vf-footer__inner">
      <p class="vf-footer__notice">
        <a class="vf-footer__link" href="//www.ebi.ac.uk/about/our-impact">This Community Space is a collaborative
          platform supported by EMBL-EBI Training and partner organisations. <br>It enables scientific communities to
          share
          and develop training resources, improve accessibility across languages and regions, and exchange knowledge and
          expertise.
        </a>
      </p>
    </div>
  </footer>

  <!-- <script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@visual-framework/ebi-header-footer@2.1.5/ebi-header-footer.js"></script> -->
  <script src="https://assets.emblstatic.net/vf/v2.5.30/scripts/scripts.js"></script>
</body>

</html>